WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.586
Two tuning forks.

00:02.690 --> 00:04.806
Two hundred and fifty-six hertz…

00:04.826 --> 00:06.896
and two hundred and sixty.

00:07.170 --> 00:08.590
Play them together.

00:11.690 --> 00:13.423
Hear the loudness swell…

00:13.443 --> 00:14.593
and fade?

00:16.490 --> 00:18.038
Those are beats.

00:18.930 --> 00:20.510
How many each second?

00:20.767 --> 00:22.090
Not the sum.

00:22.110 --> 00:23.489
Not the average.

00:23.680 --> 00:26.800
The DIFFERENCE four beats per second.

00:26.980 --> 00:31.126
The pitch you hear is the average: two hundred and fifty-eight hertz.

00:31.753 --> 00:34.829
And the swells come from the two waves drifting in and out

00:34.849 --> 00:35.799
of step.

00:38.613 --> 00:43.473
LearnLoop AI. Predict. Watch. Explain.
